title    Carousel Gallop
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Theme Park option "carousel": a galloping 12/8 shuffle in A major, organ lead over accordion off-beats, rolling banjo and a shaker. The last eight bars lift a fourth, to D major, and fall home on a plagal cadence.
tempo    132
beats    4
steps    3
reverb   0.24

voice lead    organ     vol=0.66 bright=1.3
voice bells   musicbox  vol=0.22 pan=0.45
voice squeeze accordion vol=0.26 pan=-0.35 center=E4 gate=0.6
voice banjo   banjo     vol=0.24 pan=0.35
voice bass    fmbass    vol=0.52  gate=0.75
voice rise    riser     vol=0.26
voice kick    bigkick   vol=0.6
voice clap    clap909   vol=0.45 pan=0.05
voice hat     hat909    vol=0.24 pan=0.3
voice shaker  shaker    vol=0.24 pan=-0.4
voice tamb    tamb      vol=0.22 pan=0.4
voice crash   crash     vol=0.3  pan=-0.2

